{
  "app_id": 5345040,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Fling forks, stab them into the floor, and smash without mercy. Remember: it's all fruit. Smash it all. Sometimes a fork just isn't enough. The pot swallows the world, and you come back stronger. Just when you think it's over, a new dimension is born. Catch the honey pot, juggle the Flip Sword in midair, step inside a crepe. Sweep the garden to harvest. Crank the handle all the way, and relics pour out. Mix new boons every run and chase the ultimate build. Don't fall for the cute act. The more fruit you smash, the closer you get to a secret you may not be ready for."
  },
